/ The first system event, loaded from /system/event/ when the app starts (event.setting.system load): before the app
/ starts, it writes out that it ran — there to prove the folder loads. An app's own system/event/Hello.goal replaces it.
Hello
- before the app starts, call Say

/ Writes out that the system event ran, to the channel it is given.
Say
- write out 'This is system event'
